From: Steven Enamakel <enamakel@tinyhumans.ai>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 21:53:08 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] feat(lock): take over locks left by dead processes

A lock file whose recorded pid no longer runs is now treated as stale and
replaced, so a gateway killed by a signal no longer blocks the next start.
Locks that are unreadable or owned by a live process are still refused.

Auto-committed-on: macbook
Co-authored-by: Medulla <medulla@tinyhumans.ai>
